Exemple de code problematique
messy_function &lt;- function(x,y) {
  res=x+y
  vlong &lt;- ifelse(res &gt; 0, T, F)
  output = list(sum=res, positive=vlong)
  return(output)
}
Problemes : espaces, T/F, affectations =, style non conforme.

Problematic code example
messy_function &lt;- function(x,y) {
  res=x+y
  very_long_variable_name_that_exceeds_80 &lt;- ifelse(res &gt; 0, T, F)
  output = list(sum=res, positive=very_long_variable_name)
  return(output)
}
Issues: missing spaces, T/F, long lines, = assignments, bad style.
